## Commands

- Build Android: `./gradlew :composeApp:assembleDebug`
- Tests: `./gradlew testDebugUnitTest`{% if include_library_module %} `testAndroidHostTest`{% endif %}{% if include_desktop %} `desktopTest`{% endif %}; iOS tests (`iosSimulatorArm64Test`) need macOS
{%- if include_networking %}
- Dev backend: add `-Pbuildkonfig.flavor=dev` (base URLs in `composeApp/build.gradle.kts`, `buildkonfig { }`)
{%- endif %}
- iOS: open `iosApp/iosApp.xcodeproj` in Xcode (signing team in `iosApp/Configuration/Local.xcconfig`)
{%- if include_desktop %}
- Desktop: `./gradlew :composeApp:run`
{%- endif %}
{%- if include_sonar %}
- Sonar: `SONAR_TOKEN=... ./sonar_scan.sh`
{%- endif %}

